<span id="S4.T2.3.18.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.3.18.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Disjointed response:</span> Fragmented or poorly integrated answer. For example, each paper is discussed in isolation.</span>
