<td id="S4.T2.3.26.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S4.T2.3.26.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:258.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.3.26.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.3.26.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">LLM limitations:</span> Issues inherent to the model being used, such as limited context length, lack of multi-modal understanding, and inability to access external domain knowledge and digital libraries.</span>
</span></td>
