<span id="S4.T2.3.27.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">19</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.3.27.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T2.3.27.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:258.8pt;">
<span id="S4.T2.3.27.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.T2.3.27.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Retrieval failures:</span> Required context not provided by the retriever.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S4.T2.3.27.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S4.T2.3.27.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:17.3pt;">
