<span id="A4.T4.3.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T4.3.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Q3</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T4.3.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T4.3.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:279.5pt;">
<span id="A4.T4.3.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T4.3.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">In a multi-document setting, does the answer include information from all relevant papers mentioned in your question?</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A4.T4.3.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A4.T4.3.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:27.6pt;">
<span id="A4.T4.3.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.T4.3.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">5.c</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T4.3.6" class="ltx_tr">
